Puppet Master is plans-first. Read `AGENTS.md` and `Plans/00-plans-index.md` before acting. Treat `Plans/**` as canonical, `Plans/ledgers/**` as source-lineage only, and P6/deferred ledgers as locked unless explicitly unlocked. Do not recreate legacy Rust/Iced code; the intended implementation is Rust + Slint. Run `python3 scripts/pm-plans-verify.py run-gates` after governance/plan-support changes.
